<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes down in thin trading.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes down in thin trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes lower on Monday but pulls back from earlier lows. Activity very thin.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX down 1.9 points, 0.18 percent to 1,052.8.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 5.3 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka closes down 21 crowns to 2,009.</p>
<p>* Ceska Sporitelna falls one crown to 304.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
